        {
          "description": "This collection is a set of head and neck cancer patients each of whom has had multiple PET/CT FDG scans – before and after therapy – and with follow up scans where clinically indicated.  The data were provided to help facilitate research activities of NCI's Quantitative Imaging Network.\n",
